# A knowledge base kept in a file: `voegToe` puts a Bron, `graaf` gets the Graaf of its nodes back, each node one of
# the sum `type Node = Begrip | Bron`, made in one of two arms of a choice in `node`. The class is the library's door:
# its route starts at each public method a caller can call, its constructor among them. The constructor builds the
# store the other doors run on: a value, taken by each step whose body reads the store's fields or calls on it.

route clean.bank.Kennisbank
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank()
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node              # in the arrow function handed to `map`
choice Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron()
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip()
step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf()

line entry > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() call
line entry > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe call
line entry > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf call

# the store the constructor builds, which the doors run on
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() > Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() value
line Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write value
known #new line Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value   # graaf reads this.path
line Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value

# the put: the Bron a caller hands is written into the line `write` appends to what the file held
known #new line Bron·bron > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe value
line Disk(this.path) > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write own
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write > Disk(this.path) own

# the get: the lines read, each a Bron or a Begrip, a Node in the Graaf given back
line Disk(this.path) > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf own
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron() > Bron@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip() > Begrip@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 value
line Bron@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line Begrip@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node > Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
line Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() > Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() value
line Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value
line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf > Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value

home Kennisbank@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank() Kennisbank()
home Bron·bron Kennisbank()
home Bron@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
home Begrip@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1 Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
home Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf
home Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Graaf() Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf
home Graaf@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf Kennisbank()

# the line split in three parts, each held by its name: the kind decides the choice, the uuid and the text build the node
known #new step Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split
known #new line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split value
known #new line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > _·soort@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split value
known #new line Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split value
known #new line _·soort@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node value
known #new line _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron() value
known #new line _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Bron() value
known #new line _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip() value
known #new line _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/?1/Begrip() value
known #new home _·uuid@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
known #new home _·soort@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node
known #new home _·tekst@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node/split Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node

side entry left
known #new side Disk(this.path) both          # voegToe reads what the file held and changes it: Atlas says between

# a door's parameter is a value from beyond without its name; the Bron's fields, written into the string `write` is
# handed, count as the Bron handed to it
known #new extra line Bron > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe value
known #new extra home Bron Kennisbank()
known #new extra line Bron·bron > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.voegToe/Kennisbank.write value

# graaf's own arrow takes what its steps make, the Nodes too, though only Graaf() takes them and graaf gives back the Graaf
known #new extra line Node@Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf/Kennisbank.node > Kennisbank()/Kennisbank.graaf value
